OL,3,GNEWSACouncil consultation into nursery
OL,4,Aclosures 'unreasonable', watchdog finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority has been told to
OL,7,Fapologise for the shortcomings of its
OL,8,Fconsultation into the attempted closure
OL,9,Fof five rural nurseries in southern
OL,10,FScotland.
OL,12,FScottish Borders Council's process was
OL,13,Funreasonable and amounted to
OL,14,Fmaladministration, the Scottish Public
OL,15,FServices Ombudsman found.
OL,17,FLocal parents, who were successful in
OL,18,Ftheir campaign to save the nurseries in
OL,19,FJune last year, said it was a
OL,20,F"devastating finding" for the council.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
