OL,3,GNEWSACouncil consultation into nursery
OL,4,Aclosures 'unreasonable', watchdog finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive David Robertson said
OL,7,Fthe council accepted the findings of
OL,8,Fthe report and would apologise to the
OL,9,Fcomplainant.
